# Vercel builds only the static website from this repo.
#
# `electron/` stays: the renderer imports its types (electron/preload, electron/signer).
# `api-worker/` is the separate API service on Render and is not part of this build;
# its blueprint is api-worker/render.yaml, so nothing at the repo root claims to be
# a Vercel service.
api-worker
artifacts
dist
